### Crear un nuevo turno
POST http://localhost:3000/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentDateTime": "2025-08-12T13:00:00Z",
  "offeredServiceId": "fb496378-e4a7-49ef-bb86-27c5bbe17ce1",
  "client": 
  {
    "firstName":"Valentin",
    "lastName": "Olivero",
    "phoneNumber": "54123456789",
    "email": "creenquesoygolfista@gmail.com"
  }
}

###

### Obtener todos los turnos
GET http://localhost:3000/appointments

###

### Obtener todos los turnos según estado
GET http://localhost:3000/appointments?status=2

###

### Obtener un turno por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/appointments/25513b9c-c111-4727-8a0a-94e430047153

