### Actualizar un turno por ID (IGNORAR)
PUT http://localhost:3000/appointments/80d976f3-a6f4-46b0-a3ff-0d295aff09f4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appoinmentDateTime": "2025-07-11T16:00:00Z",
  "client" : {
    "name" : "Uriel"
  }
}

